 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Lovely. Set the table on blanket and pile the bear snacks in baskets. Pop some bagels with cheese and juice. Sure, thing. Meanwhile, tell the kids about the bear's adventure. Stick sandwiches for the big ones, and stuck in one ear for the little one. Invite friend over to share a drink. Musical chairs is always a hit. Start a small box of small prizes, like little toys or sweets. Then go big. Heirloom beans and a pie of pies. Not exactly. But some old fashioned fun that everyone loves.",
